@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`order-triage` is represented in this repository by `createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts`. The factory identifies the agent as `order-triage`, sets its action to `classify-for-human-review`, and sets `canApproveRefunds` to `false`.
+
+The repository does not establish an instruction-loading or model-invocation path for this custom runtime. The registered canonical instruction must not be treated as runtime-consumed until that path is established.
